  node [shape=box];
  "Start";
  "Start" -> "Next" [label="edge text"];
}
```

## Tips

- Quote node IDs in DOT to avoid special character issues.
- Use `label` for edge text; keep it short or escape quotes.
- Use one edge per line for readability.
